o communicate with the IoT Hub. The data we get from the phone and OBD device will be stored and analyzed using Azure services based on several inputs. This would enable meaningful insights on users driving behavior.   In case of emergency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":171992,"global_rank":422890},{"name":"kmussar/American_Time_Use_Survey","owner":"kmussar","html_url":"https://github.com/kmussar/American_Time_Use_Survey","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Analysis of the American Time Use Survey from the Bureau of Labor Statistics ","topics":[],"score":171992,"global_rank":422891},{"name":"mbmcc/PPP","owner":"mbmcc","html_url":"https://github.com/mbmcc/PPP","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":171992,"global_rank":422892},{"name":"Arthur-Lozano/ElixirGame","owner":"Arthur-Lozano","html_url":"https://github.com/Arthur-Lozano/ElixirGame","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":171986,"global_rank":422894},{"name":"sannidhi/packo","owner":"sannidhi","html_url":"https://github.com/sannidhi/packo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Run all of kpack's image builds in parallel","topics":[],"score":171983,"global_rank":422895},{"name":"swehelie/SQL","owner":"swehelie","html_url":"https://github.com/swehelie/SQL","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":171983,"global_rank":422896},{"name":"agarner101/ReactSocks","owner":"agarner101","html_url":"https://github.com/agarner101/ReactSocks","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Simple Socket test